{"unit_id":"mihomooo__dsh-persona-panel#feature-1","repo":"mihomooo/dsh-persona-panel","commit":"ebfea345f335bc6116ba67b72e5e560710a4ec11","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-persona-panel 的功能「工作区记忆面板」：面板按工作区展示人设、用户画像、事件和日记，并提供条目来源、编辑与管理操作；可从侧栏、设置页或会话菜单进入。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:315","client.js:1879"]}
